# Delta Plan — carrying step 10's MCP work into step 11 (TUI)

Step 11 was branched from step 10 **before** 04-08-2026's MCP work, so it has no
MCP client, no `mcp_servers` config, and the older single-line
`~/.boukensharc` loader. This plan carries those forward.

> **Most of it is a straight copy.** `registry.rb`, `config.rb` and
> `boukensha_loader.rb` differ between the two steps **only** by the step-10
> additions — step 11 has no competing changes in any of them. The real work is
> confined to two files where step 11 *has* diverged on its own: `repl.rb`,
> which was restructured to be driven by the TUI, and `boukensha.rb`, which
> gained the `tui:` switch.

This is a **floating artifact** remediation in the instructor's sense — code a
step built that a later step's rewrite did not carry forward. `~/.boukensharc`
support has now been carried by hand twice (09 → 10, and here). **Step 12 needs
a sibling of this document**, which will be the fourth application.

